0..40 Comment "//! This source evolves a seat protocol."
41..44 Comment "//!"
45..80 Comment "//! Session subtyping gives a flow."
81..123 Comment "//! Equi-recursive unfolding gives a path."
124..180 Comment "//! A protocol with an added seat choice is a supertype."
